---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Quinocycle" description="How Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd. collects, uses, and protects your personal information.">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-24">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-on-surface mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-secondary">Last updated: 2 July 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Who We Are</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd. ("Quinocycle", "we", "us") operates www.quinocycle.com.my and supplies packaging materials from No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, Balakong, Selangor 43300, Malaysia. This policy explains how we handle personal information in accordance with the Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA) of Malaysia.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">We collect only what you choose to give us:</p>
        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Contact details</strong> — your name, phone number, and email address when you contact us via WhatsApp, phone, email, or our contact form to ask about products or place an order.</li>
          <li><strong>Order and delivery details</strong> — delivery address and order information needed to fulfil your purchase.</li>
          <li><strong>Basic usage data</strong> — standard web analytics (pages visited, device type, approximate location) used in aggregate to improve the website.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">How We Use It</h2>
        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>To respond to your enquiries and provide quotations.</li>
          <li>To process and deliver your orders.</li>
          <li>To improve our website and product range.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mt-4">We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We share delivery details only with courier or transport partners as needed to fulfil your order.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">WhatsApp and Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Enquiries sent via WhatsApp are subject to WhatsApp's own privacy policy. Our website may use third-party analytics services that set cookies; you can disable cookies in your browser settings without affecting your ability to browse the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Data Retention and Security</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">We keep enquiry and order records only as long as needed for business and legal purposes, and take reasonable steps to protect them from unauthorised access.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Under the PDPA you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. Contact us at <a href="mailto:quinocycle@gmail.com" class="text-primary underline">quinocycle@gmail.com</a> or +60 16 8916 381 and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version will always be published on this page with the date above.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
